 September 2026","value":"39.6%"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2019/12/06/29886-378294346_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"conolan (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2019/12/06/29886-378294346_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"conolan (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"That's up from 37.4% in September 2025 to 39.6% this September. Deals became more common.","query":"apartment tour American renters","subject":"apartment tour","visual":{"type":"compare","headline":"RENTAL CONCESSIONS","sub":"Deals became more common.","color":"dark","left":"September 2025","left_value":"37.4% of listings","right":"September 2026","right_value":"39.6% of listings"},"clips":[{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580587771525-78b9dba3b914?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8cmVhbCUyMGVzdGF0ZXxlbnwxfHx8fDE3OTEzMDk4Mjh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Ярослав Алексеенко (Unsplash)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580587771525-78b9dba3b914?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8cmVhbCUyMGVzdGF0ZXxlbnwxfHx8fDE3OTEzMDk4Mjh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Ярослав Алексеенко (Unsplash)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"For your apartment hunt, compare the full lease cost after incentives, not just advertised monthly rent.","query":"lease paperwork American renters","subject":"lease paperwork","visual":{"type":"list","headline":"COMPARE THE WHOLE LEASE","color":"dark","items":["Advertised monthly rent","Incentives","Full lease cost"]},"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g2978cf8dca58dc6b52c18705fab5fb2ac5bcb75926f42a6f06a292feca2325a3d0fc1a15c9ad35b37d10de98867f03f10f2e183fe9cf0444f600cea99490c2b2_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"23555986 (Pixabay)"},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g2978cf8dca58dc6b52c18705fab5fb2ac5bcb75926f42a6f06a292feca2325a3d0fc1a15c9ad35b37d10de98867f03f10f2e183fe9cf0444f600cea99490c2b2_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","